<title>ESTONIA: MAY EXPORT PRICE RISE 0.5PCT MO/MO, 8.5PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>MAY EXPORT PRICE RISE 0.5PCT MO/MO, 8.5PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian export prices rose by a</p>
<p>monthly 0.5 percent in May for a year-on-year rate of 8.5</p>
<p>percent, the country's statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN EXPORT PRICES	   May 97  April 97   May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (PCT)     0.5	 0.3	 0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (PCT)	 8.5	 7.9	14.0</p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
